  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-AM6-1/QA-AM6-2 (minor, flaky-test-qa/req-qa, corrected after an initial mis-triage): the real defect is a racy nonlocal counter in scripts/smoke/test_run_admission_capacity.py:1085, unrelated to this PR's changes. The original triage record for this finding was filed with 'file: unknown' (team-lead's compression error from a summary lacking exact detail), which caused both arch-ctm's fix attempt and arch-qa's independent QA-2 recheck to mistakenly resolve a different, already-fixed AM5 finding (WAL tempdir counter) instead of this one. Independently confirmed still open by req-qa and flaky-test-qa in QA-2 with the exact current line content. Document it as a known pre-existing issue (not introduced by AM.6) rather than fixing it as part of this closure PR, unless trivial to fix alongside the other findings -- but the closure-proof doc's note about it must describe THIS issue, not the AM5 WAL-tempdir issue it currently and incorrectly cites." ;
