  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:closureNote "Fixed @ 463b23cb (third attempt, first two mis-targeted the unrelated already-fixed AM5 WAL-tempdir issue): the racy nonlocal 'calls' counter at test_run_admission_capacity.py:1086 is now guarded by a threading.Lock() covering both the increment and the derived failure-selection check, making the sequence atomic. am6-closure-proof.md's note now accurately describes this exact issue. Independently confirmed by req-qa, arch-qa, and flaky-test-qa in QA-3." ;
